    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_ingestion_worker_node" kindref="compound">IIngestionWorkerNode</ref></computeroutput> implementation that uses <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager" kindref="compound">IngestionManager</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The node creates a fresh <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager" kindref="compound">IngestionManager</ref></computeroutput> for each <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_in_process_worker_node_1afb52de0dc17acdf9149c525ba3bafd41" kindref="member">ingest()</ref></computeroutput> call, registers the assigned sources, and returns the resulting partial report.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_in_process_worker_node_1afb52de0dc17acdf9149c525ba3bafd41" kindref="member">ingest()</ref></computeroutput> is thread-safe; concurrent calls are serialised by the <computeroutput>busy_</computeroutput> flag — if the node is already busy the call blocks until the previous run completes (the coordinator never double-dispatches to a single node, so in practice this lock is uncontended). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
